* string_concat -- grows a string one character at a time to 1000 and reports its length.
* bottleneck: string growth; cost rises with length.
        s = ''
        i = 1
loop    s = s 'x'
        i = LT(i, 1000) i + 1                           :S(loop)
        OUTPUT = 'length after 1000 appends = ' SIZE(s)
END
